mcdonalds_in.text:
@mcdonaldsinindia I’m disappointed that there has been so little communication about the PeaceMinusOne x McD Meal release tomorrow. With the launch just a day away, many people are still waiting for important details and updates.
There are fans who are willing to travel to specific outlets to purchase it, but without timely information, it becomes very difficult to plan. It would be greatly appreciated if more updates could be shared before the release, especially regarding participating locations, availability, and any last-minute details.
Please keep the community informed—we’ve been looking forward to this release and would love clearer communication leading up to launch.

